## ⚙️ Environment Variables

Variables are loaded through pydantic-settings from `.env`.
See `.env.example` for defaults.

Docker Compose uses explicit local credentials for API ↔ PostgreSQL wiring.

## 🚀 API Routes

Health endpoint:
- GET /health

Item endpoints:
- GET /api/v1/items
- GET /api/v1/items/{item_id}
- POST /api/v1/items

